  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Partnerships for Infrastructure (P4I)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">P4I&#x2019;s goal is to contribute to &#x2018;quality infrastructure development that drives sustainable, inclusive, and resilient growth in Southeast Asia&#x2019;. The end-of-investment outcomes are &#x2018;Southeast Asian agencies improve decision-making and practise towards quality infrastructure&#x2019; and &#x2018;Strong partnerships among Australian and Southeast Asian government agencies and other institutions build regional commitment to quality infrastructure investment&#x2019;. P4I focusses on the transport, energy, and telecommunications sectors, and integrates cross-cutting issues of climate change, gender equality and social inclusion.</narrative>
  </description>
